Subject: [PATCH] net: add keyed GF64 set reconciliation primitives

Provide the keyed short-ID and GF64 reconciliation API together with its arithmetic implementation and build registration. These adjacent header and implementation fragments implement one shared reconciliation feature; retain both historical sources without a separate implementation catch-up patch.

Original-Patches: ecash/006, ecash/020
Split-Ids: 7, 27
